    "description": "<p>The Abyssal unnaturally dissolves out of the path of an attack, seeking respite in the momentary peace of non-existence. He reappears all too quickly, his perfect dodge completed by re-forming him somewhere within (Essence) yards that he could have reached through conventional evasive action. This Charm can dodge undodgeable attacks, but it cannot dodge unexpected attacks. This Charm carries one of the Four Flaws of Abyssal Invulnerability.</p>",
